      <div class="hero-badge-main">
        <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#psg-badge"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-stats" aria-label="Key facts">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-stat"><strong>1st</strong><span>Hotel privacy certificate</span></div>
      <div class="hero-stat"><strong>4</strong><span>Certification pillars</span></div>
      <div class="hero-stat"><strong>GDPR</strong><span>Legal framework</span></div>
      <div class="hero-stat"><strong>Amsterdam</strong><span>Head office</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== WHY NOW ===== -->
<section class="section section-cream" id="why">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Why now</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Privacy is the new quality standard<br>in <span class="text-gold">hospitality</span></h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Guests are increasingly aware of their privacy. International media coverage, tighter regulations and higher traveller expectations make privacy protection a strategic priority for every forward-thinking hotel.</p>

    <div class="waarom-grid">
      <div class="waarom-card">
        <div class="waarom-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#psg-facet"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Guest trust is evolving</h3>
        <p>The modern traveller expects more than a clean room. Privacy and safety are increasingly factored into booking decisions. Hotels that actively demonstrate this win trust &mdash; and the reservation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="waarom-card">
        <div class="waarom-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#psg-facet"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Regulations are tightening</h3>
        <p>European privacy legislation is becoming stricter by the year. From the GDPR to the EU AI Act &mdash; hotels that invest in structural compliance now prevent future complications and position themselves as leaders.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="waarom-card">
        <div class="waarom-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#psg-facet"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Incidents make headlines</h3>
        <p>Investigative journalists and documentary makers are increasingly exposing privacy incidents in hotels. A proactive approach protects not only guests &mdash; but also your brand and partnerships.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== BENEFITS / MARKETING ===== -->
<section class="section" id="benefits">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Benefits</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Certification that goes beyond<br><span class="text-gold">protection</span> alone</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">The Privacy Shield Certificate is not just a safety standard &mdash; it is a powerful marketing instrument, a distinctive quality mark and a strategic advantage that adds immediate value.</p>

    <div class="voordelen-grid">
      <div class="voordeel-card">
        <div class="voordeel-tag marketing">Marketing</div>
        <h3>A quality mark you can display</h3>
        <p>The Privacy Shield Certificate is visible: on your website, in your lobby, on booking platforms and across all your marketing materials. A recognisable trust signal for guests who choose consciously.</p>
        <ul class="voordeel-list">
          <li>Badge for website, OTA profiles and social media</li>
          <li>Physical certificate for reception and lobby</li>
          <li>Permission to use in campaigns and press releases</li>
          <li>Distinctive mark on comparison platforms</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="voordeel-card">
        <div class="voordeel-tag trust">Guest Trust</div>
        <h3>Trust that converts</h3>
        <p>Guests increasingly choose hotels that are transparent about safety. The certificate communicates a clear message: guests are taken seriously here. That translates directly into bookings.</p>
        <ul class="voordeel-list">
          <li>Higher booking conversion among privacy-conscious travellers</li>
          <li>Positive reviews and word-of-mouth</li>
          <li>Strengthened guest satisfaction and loyalty</li>
          <li>Attractive to corporate and diplomatic clients</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="voordeel-card">
        <div class="voordeel-tag value">Asset Protection</div>
        <h3>Protect your investment</h3>
        <p>A certified hotel stands stronger &mdash; with insurers, partners and regulators. The certificate functions as demonstrable evidence that your organisation takes its duty of care seriously.</p>
        <ul class="voordeel-list">
          <li>Stronger position in insurance negotiations</li>
          <li>Demonstrable due diligence for claims or audits</li>
          <li>Structural reduction of liability risk</li>
          <li>Professional documentation for legal evidence</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="voordeel-card">
        <div class="voordeel-tag compliance">Compliance</div>
        <h3>Ready for tomorrow</h3>
        <p>Privacy requirements for hotels are only getting stricter. International hotel groups, booking platforms and insurers are setting ever higher standards. Early certification gives you a head start.</p>
        <ul class="voordeel-list">
          <li>Anticipate upcoming EU regulations</li>
          <li>Meet requirements of international hotel chains</li>
          <li>Prevent last-minute compliance costs</li>
          <li>Position your hotel as an early adopter</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== TRAINING ===== -->
<section class="section section-cream" id="training">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Training &amp; Awareness</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Your team is your<br>greatest <span class="text-gold">asset</span></h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">A certified hotel relies not just on technology &mdash; but on a well-trained team that knows how to actively protect guest privacy. The training programme is at the heart of the certificate.</p>

    <div class="training-layout">
      <div class="training-intro">
        <h3>Training at every level of your organisation</h3>
        <p>From the front desk to the boardroom: every team member receives a tailored programme suited to their role and responsibilities. Not standard e-learning, but practical training with recognisable scenarios.</p>
        <div class="training-quote">
          <p>&ldquo;The majority of privacy incidents in hotels are discovered by alert staff. Investing in your team is investing in your protection.&rdquo;</p>
        </div>
        <p>Upon completion, your organisation receives a training register &mdash; a valuable document for insurance negotiations, audits and as part of your compliance file. Periodic refresher training keeps knowledge up to date.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="training-modules">
        <div class="t-module">
          <div class="t-module-icon">1</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Housekeeping &amp; Maintenance</h4>
            <p>Recognising unusual situations, unfamiliar objects and basic procedures when suspicious items are found. Practical and visual.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="t-module">
          <div class="t-module-icon">2</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Front Desk &amp; Guest Relations</h4>
            <p>Professional communication when handling reports, escalation protocols and the right balance between discretion and action.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="t-module">
          <div class="t-module-icon">3</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Security &amp; Facility Management</h4>
            <p>Systematic procedures, collaboration with specialists and documentation. The operational backbone of the programme.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="t-module">
          <div class="t-module-icon">4</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Management &amp; Executive Board</h4>
            <p>Strategic decision-making, crisis communication and insurance protocol. Including scenario exercises and media training.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== INSURANCE & LIABILITY ===== -->
<section class="section section-off-white" id="assurance">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Assurance &amp; Insurance</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Strengthens your position with<br><span class="text-gold">insurers</span> and partners</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Insurers value hotels that proactively invest in risk prevention. The Privacy Shield Certificate provides the documentation and evidence your organisation needs &mdash; for claims, audits and negotiations.</p>

    <div class="vl-layout">
      <div class="vl-card">
        <h3>Demonstrable duty of care</h3>
        <p>Hotels have a legal duty of care towards their guests. The Privacy Shield Certificate structurally documents how your hotel fulfils this duty &mdash; through inspections, protocols and trained staff.</p>
        <p>This is not a paper exercise: it is an ongoing programme that is immediately demonstrable in every conversation with insurers, partners and regulators.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="vl-card">
        <h3>Compliance documentation in order</h3>
        <p>The programme delivers structured reports: inspection records, training registers, incident protocols and compliance evidence. Exactly the documentation that insurers, lawyers and auditors expect.</p>
        <p>Hotels with their records in order stand stronger in premium negotiations and have a head start when compliance requirements are tightened by international hotel groups or booking platforms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== CERTIFICATE ===== -->
<section class="section section-dark" id="certificate">
  <div class="cert-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">The Certificate</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">The Privacy Shield<br><span class="text-gold">Certificate</span></h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">An independent quality mark that demonstrates your hotel actively, professionally and structurally protects guest privacy. More than a mark &mdash; a complete programme.</p>

    <div class="cert-layout">
      <div class="cert-text">
        <h3>Built on four pillars</h3>
        <p>The certificate combines professional inspections, legal compliance, operational protocols and continuous monitoring. Together they form a validated programme that structurally protects your hotel &mdash; and proves it.</p>
        <div class="cert-features">
          <div class="cert-feature"><div class="cert-feature-dot"></div><div class="cert-feature-text">Professional privacy inspection by certified specialists</div></div>
          <div class="cert-feature"><div class="cert-feature-dot"></div><div class="cert-feature-text">Legal compliance with current and upcoming regulations</div></div>
          <div class="cert-feature"><div class="cert-feature-dot"></div><div class="cert-feature-text">Operational protocols &amp; staff training at four levels</div></div>
          <div class="cert-feature"><div class="cert-feature-dot"></div><div class="cert-feature-text">Continuous monitoring &amp; periodic recertification</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cert-badge-area">
        <div class="cert-badge-showcase">
          <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#psg-badge"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== PROCESS ===== -->
<section class="section section-dark" style="padding-top: 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">The Process</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">From conversation to <span class="text-gold">certification</span></h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Every journey begins with a personal conversation. We tailor the programme to your hotel, your team and your goals. Minimal disruption to your daily operations.</p>

    <div class="process-steps">
      <div class="p-step">
        <div class="p-step-circle"><div class="p-step-num">1</div></div>
        <h4>Conversation</h4>
        <p>A confidential introductory meeting about your hotel, your guests and your ambition regarding privacy and safety.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-step">
        <div class="p-step-circle"><div class="p-step-num">2</div></div>
        <h4>Assessment</h4>
        <p>An analysis of your property: guest profiles, operational context and existing procedures. Based on this, we design a tailored programme.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-step">
        <div class="p-step-circle"><div class="p-step-num">3</div></div>
        <h4>Implementation</h4>
        <p>Professional inspection, staff training and introduction of protocols. We guide your team through the entire process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-step">
        <div class="p-step-circle"><div class="p-step-num">4</div></div>
        <h4>Certification</h4>
        <p>After successful validation, your hotel receives the Privacy Shield Certificate. Including ongoing monitoring and periodic recertification.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

